00:06:10.780 --> 00:06:15.080
Even though there are rumors of a November
December Winds of Winter release date.

00:06:15.080 --> 00:06:21.940
I think the casting of Jonathan Pryce specifically
is really interesting.

00:06:21.940 --> 00:06:25.500
When I think of him I still think Bond Villain,
which is kind of awesome.

00:06:25.500 --> 00:06:28.490
A bond villain is the leader of the faith
of the seven.

00:06:28.490 --> 00:06:31.370
