00:06:43.850 --> 00:06:48.639
The High Sparrow is described as being unencumbered
by a lot of the pomp and ceremony that you

00:06:48.639 --> 00:06:50.310
would think the leader of a church would have.

00:06:50.310 --> 00:06:55.700
So he doesn’t wear crazy fancy robes or
the famous crown of the High Septon.

00:06:55.700 --> 00:07:02.260
I’m always interested in the way the show
chooses to introduce characters, I still think

00:07:02.260 --> 00:07:06.590
